OL,3,GNEWSAHow filmmaker's cheeky Instagram
OL,4,Amessage landed star
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe star and writer of a new
OL,7,Findependent film set in Liverpool has
OL,8,Fsaid the project would never have
OL,9,Fhappened if he had not sent a "cheeky
OL,10,FInstagram message" to Adolescence actor
OL,11,FHannah Walters.
OL,13,FDaniel P. Lewis said he wrote Amazing
OL,14,FGrace with Walters in mind and that "it
OL,15,Fhad to be her" for the title role. He
OL,16,Fdescribed the moment she agreed to take
OL,17,Fpart as a "pinch-me moment".
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
