OL,3,GNEWSAHow filmmaker's cheeky Instagram
OL,4,Amessage landed star
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe film tells the story of Walter, a
OL,7,Fman on the brink of a mental health
OL,8,Fbreakdown, who forms an unexpected bond
OL,9,Fwith Grace, a volunteer on a crisis
OL,10,Fhelpline.
OL,12,FLewis said the low-budget production
OL,13,Fwas only possible because Walters
OL,14,Fhelped attract other talent, including
OL,15,FJames Nelson-Joyce, Sonny Walker,
OL,16,FChanel Cresswell and television
OL,17,Fdirector Ruth Carney.
